  "description": "- The proposed development comprises the comprehensive refurbishment, extension and reconfiguration of the property to provide a high-quality four-bedroom family dwelling.\n\nThe proposals include:\n- A single-storey rear extension at ground floor level.\n- Internal alterations and reconfiguration.\n- Creation of additional accommodation within the roof space.\n- Construction of a rear dormer roof extension.\n- Installation of rooflights to the front and rear roof slopes.\n- Formation of a roof terrace at second-floor level.\n- Reinstatement of the original-style pitched roof over the front bay window.\n- Associated external alterations and refurbishment works.\n",
